Usage: castloop publish-rss-import DIRECTORY

Publish a reviewed local RSS import as a new Show from the service workspace.
Requires an open M7-compatible Worker, retained administrator key and Cloudflare upload credentials.
Validates all TOML and assets before registration; publishes the Show then Episodes sequentially.
Intermediate Episodes become public as jobs finish. The operation is not an atomic batch.
Re-running inspects acknowledged pending jobs and continues recorded progress without republishing completed inputs.
Unknown mutation outcomes remain blocked; preserve .castloop journals and inspect the existing jobs.
Completion does not authorize removal of the old host or certify subscriber migration.

Options:
  --help, -h  Show this help
